# expected.subscriber.log — TBD-pitch-capture (TASK-363 prereq)
# Per IEEE 1516.1-2010 §5.6, §5.8, §6.9, §6.11, §6.13, §4.10 the subscriber
# canonical sequence is:
SUB: CONNECT
SUB: JOIN federate=subscriber
SUB: SUBSCRIBE Vehicle Position Velocity Honk
SUB: DISCOVER class=Vehicle name=car-1 handle=<H>
SUB: REFLECT name=car-1 Position=42 Velocity=7
SUB: RECEIVE class=Honk Volume=5
SUB: RESIGN
# Above lines hand-authored from spec text. Verify against Pitch capture
# once Agent E's TASK-363 (Pitch EULA review) clears.
